luajit_dbg.py
-------------

The LuaJIT debugger extension, from src/luajit_dbg.py of
https://github.com/tarantool/luajit (the LuaJIT of Tarantool):

- base: commit c4cf7f367fe709f032e7e7f176379579603fff1e, the head of
  the branch elhimov/gh-13094-dbg-avoid-hardcoded-enums by Mikhail
  Elhimov (four commits on tarantool/master 8af934d9);
- lj-gctop: ported from src/luajit-gdb.py of the branch
  elhimov/gh-noticket-gdb-gctop (Sergey Kaplun 53d24a63, Mikhail
  Elhimov 42e6a904);
- the changes of this repository on top, listed by `git log
  luajit_dbg.py`.

